## ⬇️ Installation

### Installation of the CLI

#### Installation via [Cargo Binstall]

```bash
cargo binstall -y {{ package.name }}
```

#### Installation via [mise]

```bash
mise use -g github:artob/bitcache
```

#### Installation via [Cargo]

```bash
cargo install {{ package.name }} --locked --features=cli
```

#### Downloading Release Tarballs

```bash
wget {{ github.repository.link }}/releases/download/{{ package.version }}/{{ package.name }}-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz
wget {{ github.repository.link }}/releases/download/{{ package.version }}/{{ package.name }}-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz
wget {{ github.repository.link }}/releases/download/{{ package.version }}/{{ package.name }}-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz
wget {{ github.repository.link }}/releases/download/{{ package.version }}/{{ package.name }}-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip
wget {{ github.repository.link }}/releases/download/{{ package.version }}/{{ package.name }}-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz
```

### Installation of the Library

<details>
<summary>Installation from Crates.io</summary>

#### Installation from [Crates.io]

```bash
cargo add {{ package.name }}
```
</details>

<details>
<summary>Configuration in <code>Cargo.toml</code></summary>

#### Configuration in `Cargo.toml`

Enable all default features:

```toml
[dependencies]
{{ package.name }} = { version = "0" }
```

Enable only specific features:

```toml
[dependencies]
{{ package.name }} = { version = "0", default-features = false, features = ["alloc"] }
```
</details>

